Qenai.co requires an automated blog publishing system that enables AI-generated content to be seamlessly pushed via automation tools (n8n) and rendered with exceptional performance for SEO optimization.
1.2 Business Context
As an AI automation consultancy, Qenai needs to:
Publish technical content regularly to establish thought leadership
Automate content creation and publishing workflows
Achieve superior page load speeds for SEO ranking
Maintain a modern, neuromorphic design aesthetic
1.3 Solution Approach
Build a fully automated blog system using:
Frontend: Next.js 14 (App Router) + shadcn/ui
Backend: Convex (Database + API + File Storage)
Content: Markdown (MDX) with rich media support
Automation: n8n integration via Convex HTTP Actions
